<title>UK: Unilever declines comment on Danone talk.</title>
<headline>Unilever declines comment on Danone talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food to detergent group Unilever Plc/NV on Thursday declined to commment on market rumours centred in Paris that it was preparing a bid for food group Danone.</p>
<p>&quot;We never comment on such rumours,&quot; said a Unilever spokesman.</p>
<p>Since Unilever announced the sale of its speciality chemicals division earlier this month, expected to raise some 5 billion stg, it has been besieged with rumours.</p>
<p>Reckitt and Colman and Cadbury Schweppes have been most widely quoted as potential takeover targets. Unilever shares were off 13p at 1620p in early trade.</p>
<p>- Tim Farrand, London newsroom +44 171 542 6437</p>
